  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWith a wide sweeping road frontage, this sunfilled levelsite, delivers the ultimate spot to sit back, relax and enjoy the wonderful lifestyle this unique location affords.\r\n\r\nGenerous proportions reflect throughout the interior of this extremely spacious, predominantly brick and weatherboard home, where easy living flows from the inside out.\r\n\r\nBig open plan living areas, oversized windows, and glass sliders create a constant connection with the outdoors and entertaining areas, where everyone can gather, eat, drink and be merry.\r\n\r\nThere are two large generous bedrooms including a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and direct access to the bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis home offers abundant storage, including a double garage with internal entry, an attic space and plenty of further offstreet parking.\r\n\r\nThe location is a true selling point, situated on the flat of Manly within an easy stroll of the local school, the beautiful surrounding parklands, Manly beach and all the sporting and recreational facilities unique to this wonderful area.\r\n\r\nA cosmetic refresh would further enhance the faded beauty of this unique and highly sought-after property.\r\n\r\nIdeal for those looking to downsize or seeking easy care, freehold living.",
